34
00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:53.280
Right back at you.

35
00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.969
- I'll take that.
- Hey!

36
00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:01.760
<font color="#D900D9">ALL GRUNTING</font>

37
