44
00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:23.288
<font color="#D900D9">ALL CHEERING</font>

45
00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:29.962
Oh, guys, does it get
any better than this?

46
00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:32.088
Yeah, but I want to be down there.

47
00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:35.205
